# API Keys (gitignored — copy this file to `.claude/keys.md` and fill it in)

Runtime secrets the pipeline reads through `lib/api_keys.py`. One `## Section` per service,
one `- API Key: \`...\`` line each. Lines still holding a `PASTE_..._HERE` placeholder are
ignored, so an unfilled section is simply treated as "not configured".

Environment variables override this file (GEMINI_API_KEY, FAL_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, PEXELS_API_KEY,
PIXABAY_API_KEY, COVERR_API_KEY, METRICOOL_TOKEN).

## Gemini (REQUIRED — transcription of the avatar audio + source videos; optional QC grading)
- API Key: `PASTE_GEMINI_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  (enable billing on the project for reliable quotas)

## fal (image provider option A — config images.provider = "fal")
- API Key: `PASTE_FAL_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys

## OpenAI (image provider option B — config images.provider = "openai")
- API Key: `PASTE_OPENAI_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys  (gpt-image-1 may require organisation verification)

<!-- Image provider option C ("google") reuses the Gemini key above — nothing else to add. -->

## Pexels (stock b-roll — free, recommended)
- API Key: `PASTE_PEXELS_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://www.pexels.com/api/

## Pixabay (stock b-roll — optional second source)
- API Key: `PASTE_PIXABAY_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://pixabay.com/api/docs/

## Coverr (stock b-roll — optional third source)
- API Key: `PASTE_COVERR_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://coverr.co/api

## Metricool (optional posting fallback — config posting.metricool.enabled = true)
- API Key: `PASTE_METRICOOL_TOKEN_HERE`
- Get one: https://i.mtr.cool/maestrosdaia
- Header: X-Mc-Auth

## HeyGen (API — the pipeline generates the avatar video via api.heygen.com, not the browser)
- API Key: `PASTE_HEYGEN_API_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://app.heygen.com -> Settings -> API (pay-as-you-go wallet, separate from the
  subscription-minutes used by the old browser path)
- `config.avatar.heygen_avatar_id` = the avatar_id of your avatar (digital twin), found via
  `GET https://api.heygen.com/v3/avatars/looks?avatar_type=digital_twin&ownership=private`
  (header `X-Api-Key`) or already known from a sibling project using the same account/avatar.
- Email/Password below are the FALLBACK browser-login path (`generate-avatar-heygen` skill) — DORMANT
  since 06/10/2026 (HeyGen's Cloudflare blocks automated browser logins; confirmed hard blocker).
  Keep filled only in case the browser path is ever revived.
- Email: `PASTE_HEYGEN_EMAIL_HERE`
- Password: `PASTE_HEYGEN_PASSWORD_HERE`

## Instagram (browser login — used only if the saved session expires)
- Email: `PASTE_INSTAGRAM_EMAIL_HERE`
- Password: `PASTE_INSTAGRAM_PASSWORD_HERE`
- Saved session: `.claude/auth/instagram-storage-state.json` (written by the setup wizard after your first login)

## ManyChat (optional — comment→DM automation; Google/Facebook SSO, no password stored)
- Saved session: `.claude/auth/manychat-storage-state.json`
- Get one: https://manychat.partnerlinks.io/iyoaakb3km0q

## ElevenLabs (REQUIRED — cheap draft narration for the pre-HeyGen audio-approval gate)
- API Key: `PASTE_ELEVENLABS_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys (same account as the cloned avatar voice)
- `config.avatar.elevenlabs_voice_id` = the voice_id of your cloned voice (list via
  `GET https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/voices` with header `xi-api-key`), same voice as `config.avatar.voice`

## Buffer (optional — Facebook/TikTok/YouTube auto-posting, config posting.buffer.enabled)
- API Key: `PASTE_BUFFER_KEY_HERE`
- Get one: https://publish.buffer.com/settings/api (needs the free plan's "Explore Buffer API"
  first-run flow; key is a GraphQL Bearer token, set a long expiration — e.g. 1 year)
- Header: Authorization: Bearer <key>
- organization_id / channel ids go in config/config.json -> posting.buffer.*, not here

## Painel (dono) — aprovação dos Reels no Painel do Dono (Recursos Cognitivos) antes de publicar
- API Key: `PASTE_PAINEL_TOKEN_HERE`
- Mesmo token usado por `content_factory`/`painel` no repositório `ecossistema-ia-recursos-cognitivos`
  (`CONTENT_FACTORY_API_TOKEN` — pedir pro dono, não é gerado aqui).
- URL: configurada em `config/config.json` -> `painel.url` (padrão:
  `https://painel.recursoscognitivos.com.br`), não aqui.
- Usado por `post-pipeline/enviar_para_painel.py` — ver NOTAS_DONO.md.
